      "desc": "<table style=\"width: 100%; height: 272px;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 14.0312%;\"><col style=\"width: 14.4766%;\"><col style=\"width: 14.4766%;\"><col style=\"width: 14.6993%;\"><col style=\"width: 5.56793%;\"><col style=\"width: 8.68597%;\"><col style=\"width: 5.79065%;\"><col style=\"width: 5.56793%;\"><col style=\"width: 8.01782%;\"><col style=\"width: 4.00891%;\"><col style=\"width: 4.45434%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 17px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: left; height: 17px;\" colspan=\"11\"><strong>BASIC ATTACKS</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 19px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: left; height: 19px;\" colspan=\"11\"><strong>Heavy Tackle</strong> ✦ <strong>[MIG + MIG]&nbsp;</strong>✦&nbsp;<strong>Melee ✦ </strong><strong>[HR + 6] Physical </strong>damage.<strong><br></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 19px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: left; height: 19px;\" colspan=\"11\"><strong>Boulder Throw</strong> ✦ <strong>[MIG + DEX] ✦ Range ✦ [HR + 6] Earth&nbsp;</strong>damage.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 17px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: left; height: 17px;\" colspan=\"11\"><strong>SPECIAL RULES</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 19px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: left; height: 19px;\" colspan=\"11\"><strong>Elemental ✦ </strong>T. T. is immune to&nbsp;<strong>poisoned</strong>.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 53px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: left; height: 53px;\" colspan=\"11\"><strong>Protect Companion ✦ </strong>When your companion is threatened by an <strong>attack, spell</strong> or other <strong>danger</strong>, , you may take their place (any Checks that are part of the danger will be performed against you; you may declare the use of this Skill <strong>before or after</strong> the Checks have been made). If the danger already affected you, it affects you <strong>twice </strong>(resolve both instances separately); you also cannot protect multiple creatures from the same danger. If you use this Skill during a conflict, you cannot use it again until the start of your next turn.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 19px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: left; height: 19px;\" colspan=\"11\"><strong>Final Crumble ✦ </strong>When reduced to 0 HP, T. T. body crumbles on the attacker. If the attack is <strong>Melee,&nbsp;</strong>the attacker takes <strong>10 earth</strong> damage and suffer <strong>slow</strong>.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
